{
  "schema": "trueopen-task-generation-params-ranges-v1",
  "contract": "DecodingParamsV1 value ranges",
  "notes": [
    "Ranges are inclusive: temperature_milli 0..2000, top_p_ppm 1..1000000, presence_penalty_milli and frequency_penalty_milli -2000..2000, repetition_penalty_ppm 100000..2000000, and top_k 0..generation.top_k_max of task.v1 Params (0 disables top-k). Every case changes one field of the generation_params_v1.json base and is reproduced by the Node implementation.",
    "Two producers check the ranges. The TaskOrderV3 projection (TRUEOPEN_TASK_ORDER_V3, so task_hash and the signed order) rejects every out-of-range value except top_k, which it does not bound. The generation parameter payload (TRUEOPEN_TASK_GENERATION_PARAMS_V1, derived by the Keeper at admission) rejects all of them, top_k against the registered limit. A top_k above the limit therefore yields a valid task_hash for an order the Keeper still refuses.",
    "An accepted case publishes the canonical payload and its digest; the base is model_id, profile_version, task_type and output_budget_bucket of generation_params_v1.json. The limits are the default task.v1 Params generation limits, listed below.",
    "min-1 of an unsigned field whose minimum is 0 is not encodable and has no case. The chain fills no default for any of these fields; a client that offers defaults must show them to the signer, because every value enters task_hash.",
    "reason is the Node error text at the time the vector was produced. It is informative: match on expect, not on the text."
  ],
  "base_vector": "task/generation_params_v1.json",
  "limits": {
    "max_output_tokens": 131072,
    "stop_sequence_max_bytes_each": 128,
    "stop_sequence_max_items": 16,
    "stop_sequence_max_total_bytes": 1024,
    "stop_token_max_items": 64,
    "top_k_max": 1000
  },
  "ranges": {
    "temperature_milli": {
      "min": 0,
      "max": 2000,
      "unit": "1/1000; 1000 means 1.0"
    },
    "top_p_ppm": {
      "min": 1,
      "max": 1000000,
      "unit": "1/1000000; 1000000 means 1.0"
    },
    "top_k": {
      "min": 0,
      "max_param": "task.v1 Params generation.top_k_max",
      "default_max": 1000,
      "note": "0 disables top-k"
    },
    "presence_penalty_milli": {
      "min": -2000,
      "max": 2000,
      "unit": "1/1000; 0 is neutral"
    },
    "frequency_penalty_milli": {
      "min": -2000,
      "max": 2000,
      "unit": "1/1000; 0 is neutral"
    },
    "repetition_penalty_ppm": {
      "min": 100000,
      "max": 2000000,
      "unit": "1/1000000; 1000000 means 1.0"
    }
  },
